    {
      "source": "Create a new unmodifiable view of the specified mapping. Methods that attempt to\nmodify the returned map will throw <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/UnsupportedOperationException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>UnsupportedOperationException</code></a>s.",
